Recalculate ALBI from raw liver labs for the exact cohort and exact landmark windows defined below.

ALBI formula:

bilirubin_umol_L = bilirubin_mg_dL × 17.104
albumin_g_L = albumin_g_dL × 10

ALBI =
0.66 × log10(bilirubin_umol_L)
− 0.085 × albumin_g_L

mALBI:
Grade 1: <= -2.60
Grade 2a: > -2.60 and <= -2.27
Grade 2b: > -2.27 and <= -1.39
Grade 3: > -1.39

